# NOTE: no dist/ ignore — widget/dist/ is intentionally tracked (widget.js is a single
# hand-authored file with no build step, and the Dockerfile COPYs widget/dist into the
# image). A blanket dist/ rule would silently drop any new widget asset from deploys.
